@startuml 时序图_答题流程
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false

title 408Master 答题流程时序图

actor 学生 as student #E3F2FD
participant "学生端\nVue 3" as vue
participant "Nginx" as nginx
participant "后端\nExamPaperController" as controller
participant "ExamPaperService" as paper_svc
participant "QuestionService" as question_svc
participant "ExamPaperAnswerService" as answer_svc
database "MySQL" as mysql

== 1. 浏览试卷列表 ==
student -> vue : 进入试卷中心
vue -> nginx : GET /api/student/exam/paper/page
nginx -> controller : page()
controller -> paper_svc : page(request)
paper_svc -> mysql : SELECT t_exam_paper\nWHERE deleted=0
mysql --> paper_svc : 试卷列表
paper_svc --> controller : PageInfo<ExamPaper>
controller --> nginx : RestResponse
nginx --> vue : JSON
vue --> student : 展示试卷列表

== 2. 开始考试 ==
student -> vue : 点击「开始考试」
vue -> nginx : POST /api/student/exam/paper/select/45
nginx -> controller : select(45)
controller -> paper_svc : select(45)
paper_svc -> mysql : SELECT t_exam_paper\nWHERE id=45
mysql --> paper_svc : 试卷信息(含题目JSON)
paper_svc --> controller : ExamPaperVO
controller --> nginx : RestResponse<ExamPaperVO>
nginx --> vue : 试卷+题目数据
vue --> student : 进入答题页面\n显示题目+选项

== 3. 提交答题 ==
student -> vue : 逐题作答后点击「提交」
vue -> nginx : POST /api/student/exam/paper/answer/answerSubmit
nginx -> controller : answerSubmit(answerVO)
controller -> answer_svc : answerSubmit(answerVO)

answer_svc -> mysql : INSERT t_exam_paper_answer\n(总分、用时、状态)
answer_svc -> mysql : INSERT t_exam_paper_question_customer_answer\n(逐题答案、得分)

' 客观题自动判分
answer_svc -> question_svc : judgeQuestion(answer)
question_svc -> mysql : SELECT correct_answer\nFROM t_question
question_svc --> answer_svc : 判分结果

' 更新学习事件
answer_svc -> mysql : INSERT student_learning_event\n(答题事件、正确率、耗时)
answer_svc -> mysql : INSERT/UPDATE student_mistake_book\n(错题记录，如答错)

answer_svc --> controller : 提交结果
controller --> nginx : RestResponse
nginx --> vue : 提交成功
vue --> student : 显示得分结果

== 4. 查看答卷详情 ==
student -> vue : 点击「查看结果」
vue -> nginx : POST /api/student/exam/paper/read/45
nginx -> controller : read(45)
controller -> answer_svc : read(45)
answer_svc -> mysql : SELECT t_exam_paper_answer\n+ t_exam_paper_question_customer_answer
mysql --> answer_svc : 答题详情
answer_svc --> controller : ExamPaperReadVO
controller --> nginx : RestResponse
nginx --> vue : 逐题答案+正确答案+解析
vue --> student : 展示答题报告

@enduml
